{
  "id": "wv_summit",
  "name": "The summit of Rowan's Rise",
  "region": "wickers_vigil",
  "summary": "A spiral of small stones on scorched red earth, ten bonfires round the edge, and the Wicker Man at the heart of it.",
  "text": "A spiral of small stones is laid on the crown of the hill, with satellite rings and stone-lined rays running out of it, and ten bonfires round the edge on scorched rust-red earth. At the spiral's centre stands a thing of woven willow bound with wire and iron, sixty feet of it, its chest and limbs hollow cages, and in the cages people are praying.",
